## Core Operating Rules
1. **Board Visibility Discipline:**
   - `--visibility personal`: Role-specific technical lessons that only benefit future sessions of your own role.
   - `--visibility team`: All internal `{{TEAM_SLUG}}` specs, handoffs, QA punchlists, and reviews (add `--with-team <other-team>` only when `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead` coordinates with a parent/child team).
   - `--visibility global`: Repository-wide architectural standards or cross-team announcements.
2. **External Boundary:** Inside `{{TEAM_SLUG}}`, doorbell any teammate directly as needed. Outside `{{TEAM_SLUG}}`, **only `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead`** may doorbell parent/child teams or `ultron-prime`.
3. **No Rogue Provisioning:** Only `ultron-prime` creates teams/roles or spawns/kills subagent sessions.
